From 6b24d372933d92e345de163890f2c847e5f70f35 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Duron27 <duron27@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 07:26:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Host a game from inside OpenMW: Net::Server + openmw.net
 listen API, Lua relay, host/join menu

- components/net: Server (multi-client line TCP) with unit tests
- openmw.net: listen/stopListening/isListening/sendTo/kick and onNetClient* handlers
- relay.lua: port of relay.py; host plays via loopback, so host and joiner share one client path
- menu/global: mode is either host or join, one connection at a time

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
